Hello Johan,

If you want to participate to the Buildroot mailing list, could you
please subscribe to the normal mailing list, and not the digest version
(which sends you an e-mail every week or so) ? By using the digest
version, you break the threading of the discussions. Digest version is
really only for people who only want to *read* the list. As soon as you
want to send mails to the list, the digest version is really not
appropriate.

You can switch from digest version to non-digest at
http://lists.busybox.net/mailman/listinfo/buildroot.

Best regards,

